WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.089 --> 00:00:14.297
Whoosh! zoomed over Metro City.

2
00:00:14.317 --> 00:00:17.619
"I have to stop those pirates," she thought.

3
00:00:20.761 --> 00:00:22.683
She spotted The Wharf and saw people outside.

4
00:00:23.283 --> 00:00:24.124
They looked scared.

5
00:00:25.004 --> 00:00:27.186
A loud crash came from inside the restaurant.

6
00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:29.588
Then Roxy heard laughter.

7
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.040
Roxy rushed in.

8
00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:39.062
Food and broken plates covered the floor.

9
00:00:40.022 --> 00:00:42.323
People were hiding behind chairs and under tables.

10
00:00:42.343 --> 00:00:44.803
"This is terrible!"

11
00:00:45.224 --> 00:00:45.944
a woman cried.

12
00:00:45.964 --> 00:00:48.465
"I should have eaten at home!"

13
00:00:49.965 --> 00:00:53.606
Mean-looking pirates stood around one long table, shouting and laughing.

14
00:00:54.706 --> 00:00:55.847
A waiter stood on the table.

15
00:00:57.127 --> 00:00:59.688
He shook with fear as the pirates pointed swords at him.

16
00:01:01.212 --> 00:01:03.353
"You're going to walk the plank!"

17
00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:04.734
one pirate shouted.

18
00:01:05.494 --> 00:01:06.734
A parrot sat on her shoulder.

19
00:01:06.754 --> 00:01:08.195
"The plank!"

20
00:01:08.495 --> 00:01:09.195
the parrot said.

21
00:01:09.916 --> 00:01:10.896
The waiter bit his lip.

22
00:01:11.436 --> 00:01:13.457
"I wish Rocket Girl was here!"

23
00:01:13.477 --> 00:01:15.838
"Who's Rocket Girl?"

24
00:01:16.038 --> 00:01:16.778
the pirate asked.

25
00:01:16.798 --> 00:01:18.419
"Who's Rocket Girl?"

26
00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:19.299
the parrot said.

27
00:01:19.319 --> 00:01:21.360
"I am!"

28
00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:22.261
Roxy said.

29
00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:25.262
"And I'm putting a stop to this right now!"

30
00:01:26.882 --> 00:01:28.183
The pirates spun around.

31
00:01:28.203 --> 00:01:30.624
"Whew!" the waiter said.

32
00:01:31.168 --> 00:01:32.329
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

33
00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:34.591
Roxy glared at the pirates.

34
00:01:35.291 --> 00:01:37.954
"This is not how you behave in a restaurant!"

35
00:01:37.974 --> 00:01:43.038
"My name is Bonnie Bones," the pirate with the parrot said.

36
00:01:43.058 --> 00:01:46.701
"We're pirates, and we behave any way we like.

37
00:01:47.461 --> 00:01:49.943
We rob banks and we cause trouble!"

38
00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:51.785
She kicked a chair.

39
00:01:51.805 --> 00:01:54.247
"Yo-ho-ho!" the parrot said.

40
00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:57.449
"You're all under arrest," Roxy said.

41
00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:00.452
Bonnie Bones pointed her hook at Roxy.

42
00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:02.420
"Get her, men!"

43
00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:06.581
"Arr!" The pirates charged toward Roxy, waving their swords.

44
00:02:07.402 --> 00:02:10.243
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

45
00:02:11.523 --> 00:02:12.883
One pirate's sword exploded.

46
00:02:14.804 --> 00:02:17.244
Roxy ducked as another pirate swung his sword at her.

47
00:02:18.045 --> 00:02:19.545
The sword split a table in half.

48
00:02:20.445 --> 00:02:21.846
The third pirate stepped closer.

49
00:02:22.766 --> 00:02:24.707
The tip of his sword brushed Roxy's nose.

50
00:02:28.328 --> 00:02:29.468
you're in trouble!"

51
00:02:29.964 --> 00:02:32.526
He laughed.

52
00:02:32.546 --> 00:02:37.869
"I'll—" Just then police officers rushed into the restaurant.

53
00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:39.751
Three pirates froze.

54
00:02:41.812 --> 00:02:43.413
But Bonnie Bones ran for the door.

55
00:02:45.595 --> 00:02:46.675
Roxy shot after her.

56
00:02:46.695 --> 00:02:50.538
"Arr!" Bonnie Bones shouted.

57
00:02:50.558 --> 00:02:54.060
"You'll never catch me, Rocket Girl!"

58
00:02:57.082 --> 00:02:59.504
She climbed into a big pirate ship in the parking lot.

59
00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.160
Rumble, rumble!

60
00:03:03.381 --> 00:03:05.481
The ship lifted off the ground and flew away.

61
00:03:05.501 --> 00:03:08.922
"Stop!" Roxy flew after the ship.

62
00:03:11.503 --> 00:03:14.144
Creak! A hatch on the side of the ship opened.

63
00:03:15.084 --> 00:03:16.504
Roxy saw something inside.

64
00:03:18.045 --> 00:03:19.845
The thing was shiny, with sharp teeth.

65
00:03:20.605 --> 00:03:23.546
Its jaws snapped open and shut as it flew out of the ship.

66
00:03:26.587 --> 00:03:27.807
Chomp! Chomp!

67
00:03:28.328 --> 00:03:29.228
It snapped at Roxy.

68
00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:32.523
"A flying robot shark!"

69
00:03:32.884 --> 00:03:33.625
Roxy cried.

70
00:03:34.707 --> 00:03:35.829
Bonnie Bones laughed.

71
00:03:37.312 --> 00:03:39.656
"Good-bye, Rocket Girl!"

72
00:03:40.518 --> 00:03:41.379
The parrot laughed.

73
00:03:42.481 --> 00:03:43.743
"Good-bye, Rocket Girl!"
